 flowchart TD
    A["What are you deploying?"] -->|ML models, pipelines, evaluation workflows| B["Use MLOps Stacks"]
    A -->|Notebooks, workflows, DLTs, ML models, dashboards| C["Use Declarative Automation Bundles"]

    B --> D{"Need full ML lifecycle support?"}
    D -->|Yes| E["Use MLOps Stacks (includes CI/CD, governance, templates)"]
    D -->|No| F["Consider DABs if only deployment is needed"]

    C --> G{"Is this part of a broader DevOps pipeline?"}
    G -->|Yes| H["Use DABs with GitHub Actions / Azure DevOps"]
    G -->|No| I["Use DABs locally or with VS Code extension"]

    E --> J["Best for ML teams using MLflow, Mosaic AI, Unity Catalog"]
    I --> K["Best for data engineers or hybrid teams managing diverse assets"]
    F --> K 
    H --> J
    